{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52179","headline":"颂六十二首 四 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三山羽化竟无成，五热殷忧徒自萦。\n并入繁（一作「樊」）笼处尘馆，何如寂虑出危城。\n镜智圆规光且净，月行驰轮皎复晴。\n侧径崎岖尔回辙，通庄达老岂同征。\n（见同书同卷《入道部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52179.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52179","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}